  "label": "Global Waste Crisis",
  "description": "The meme references the global waste crisis, a phenomenon where waste generation outpaces recycling and disposal capacity. This requires knowledge of global waste statistics, the role of developing nations as dumping grounds, and the economic and environmental costs of improper waste disposal. It frames the image as part of a larger, systemic problem.",
